# HW2 Reproducible Runs

Install dependencies from the repository root:

```bash
python3 -m pip install -r code/requirements.txt
```

Start Ollama and make sure the documented local model is available:

```bash
ollama serve
ollama pull qwen2:7b
```

Run the offline graph check:

```bash
python code/test_stateful_agent_graph.py
```

Run one real invocation of the graph (streams each node's output):

```bash
python code/stateful_agent_graph.py --input reports/hw02/cases/schema_input.json
```

Reproduce the Part 3 Step 6 self-correction loop (reviewer_node forced to always report an issue, so the Supervisor keeps routing back to the Planner until the turn ceiling):

```bash
python code/demo_correction_loop.py
```

Run Part 4 experiments:

```bash
python code/run_hw2_experiments.py
python code/analyze_hw2_experiments.py
```

The frozen inputs are in `reports/hw02/cases/`; raw results are written to `reports/hw02/raw/`.
